Coelacanth, arapaima gibi eski{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
okul{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} balıkları{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}!{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} İsimleri{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bile
ağız{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} dolusu, ha?

