EN:
Today, you'll be catching {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tuna{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
All tuna, all the time.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}It's like I always say:{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
you can tune a piano,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
but you can't {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tuna{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} fish!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Heh.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Heh heh.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Heh heh HORF!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Get it? Tune a fish?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Kids today have no sense of humor.

TRANSLATION:
